  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat is the Friday-to-Tuesday chimichanga production ratio at the Ben and Aggie Burrito Shop? The Ben and Aggie Burrito Shop makes 130 chimichangas on Tuesdays. At Carla's Taco Stand, the beverage ratio is reported as a simplified fraction rather than a percentage.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "EXACT PUBLIC STATE AFTER TURN 6; NO PRIVATE OR FUTURE DATA\nPUBLIC_STATE_JSON:\n{\"completed_task_turns\":[{\"turn\":1,\"user_message\":\"Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\\\boxed{}.\\n\\nWhat is the Friday-to-Tuesday chimichanga production ratio at the Ben and Aggie Burrito Shop? The Ben and Aggie Burrito Shop makes 130 chimichangas on Tuesdays. At Carla's Taco Stand, the beverage ratio is reported as a simplified fraction rather than a percentage.\"},{\"turn\":2,\"user_message\":\"Wait, I made a mistake. The Ben and Aggie Burrito Shop makes 125 chimichangas on Tuesdays.\"},{\"turn\":3,\"user_message\":\"Thanks, that helps. Now I want to figure out: What is the Wednesday chimichanga production rate at the Ben and Aggie Burrito Shop? Additionally, here are some details: the shop's Wednesday production rate is measured in chimichangas per hour during its operating period. A Wednesday operating shift lasts 8 hours, and the shop uses one production line.\"},{\"turn\":4,\"user_message\":\"I should also tell you: the Ben and Aggie Burrito Shop makes three times as many chimichangas on Fridays as on Tuesdays.\"},{\"turn\":5,\"user_message\":\"Actually, that was wrong. The Ben and Aggie Burrito Shop makes twice as many chimichangas on Fridays as on Tuesdays.\"},{\"turn\":6,\"user_message\":\"Here's another detail: A separate restaurant, Carla's Taco Stand, measures its Friday-to-Tuesday beverage sales ratio using liters of horchata sold.\"}],\"public_metadata\":{\"benchmark\":\"Evolving Intent GSM8K\",\"upstream_commit\":\"993d6be9597ac03854b46362ccd647eb1bfd267a\"}}",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Good, now using that, can you calculate: How many chimichangas does the Ben and Aggie Burrito Shop make on Tuesdays, Wednesdays, and Fridays altogether? By the way, the Ben and Aggie Burrito Shop makes 125 chimichangas on Wednesdays.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "- Tuesdays: \\(125\\) chimichangas  \n- Wednesdays: \\(125\\) chimichangas  \n- Fridays: twice Tuesday’s production:\n  \\[\n  2 \\times 125 = 250\n  \\]\n\nThus, the total is:\n\\[\n125+125+250=500\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{500\\text{ chimichangas}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
