  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "The Friday production amount is not provided. Knowing that 130 chimichangas are made on Tuesday only lets us express the ratio as\n\n\\[\n\\text{Friday-to-Tuesday ratio}=\\frac{\\text{Friday production}}{130}.\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the ratio cannot be determined from the given information.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
